"╭ ● shop · local ──────────────────────────────────────────╮"
"│╭ ╭ keys ──────────────────────────────────────────────╮─╮│"
"││ │                                                    │ ││"
"││ │  EDITOR                                            │ ││"
"││ │       ⏎  run the statement under the cursor        │ ││"
"││ │   ⌥⏎ ⇧⏎  break the line                            │ ││"
"││ │       →  take the faded rest after the cursor      │ ││"
"│╰─│  ^space  list the names that fit here              │─╯│"
"│╭ │      ^g  ask the [ai] command for SQL              │─╮│"
"││ │      ^e  edit the saved query in $EDITOR           │ ││"
"││ │                                                    │ ││"
"││ │  ANYWHERE                                          │ ││"
"││ │      ^p  find a saved query                        │ ││"
"││ │      ^t  find a table of the schema                │ ││"
"││ │     esc  cancel the running statement              │ ││"
"││ │     tab  next pane: editor, bar, result, sidebar   │ ││"
"││ │      F1  these keys, from the editor too           │ ││"
"│╰─│                                                    │─╯│"
